# Generated model-tasting gallery inputs. Canonical immutable dishes live in /dishes.
/public/data/registry.json
/public/dishes/
/public/.taste-dishes-*

# Local audit trail for the one-time historical analysis.
# Findings committed to the project must be paraphrased and sanitized.
/private/

# Built public registry and exact input previews are generated from canonical sources.
/public/data/
